  "job_B14.21_20251003_114306": {
    "text": "\u00d0is synd \u00f0a fri\u00f0mal & \u00f0a forword, \u00f0e \u00e6thelred cyng & ealle his witan wi\u00f0 \u00f0one here gedon habba\u00f0, \u00f0e\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6rost, \u00fe\u00e6t woroldfri\u00f0 stande betweox \u00e6thelrede cynge & eallum his leodscipe & eallum \u00f0am here,\n& gif \u00e6nig sciphere on Englaland hergie, \u00fe\u00e6t we habban heora ealra fultum; & we him sculon mete\n& \u00e6lc \u00f0\u00e6ra landa \u00f0e \u00e6nigne fri\u00f0ige \u00f0\u00e6ra \u00f0e \u00e6nglaland hergie, beo hit utlah wi\u00f0 us & wi\u00f0 ealne here.\n& \u00e6lc ceapscip fri\u00f0 h\u00e6bbe, \u00f0e binnan mu\u00f0an cuman, \u00f0eh hit unfri\u00f0scyp sy, gyf hit undrifen bi\u00f0.\n& \u00f0eh hit gedriuen beo & hit \u00e6tfleo to hwilcre fri\u00f0byrig, & \u00f0a menn up \u00e6tberstan into \u00f0\u00e6re byrig,\n& \u00e6lc agenra fri\u00f0manna fri\u00f0 h\u00e6bbe, ge on lande ge on w\u00e6tere, ge binnan mu\u00f0an ge butan.\nGyf \u00e6\u00f0elredes cynges fri\u00f0man cume on unfri\u00f0land, & se here \u00f0\u00e6rto cume, h\u00e6bbe fri\u00f0 his scip & ealle\nGyf he his scip upp getogen h\u00e6bbe o\u00f0\u00f0on hulc geworhtne o\u00f0\u00f0on geteld geslagen: \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0\u00e6r fri\u00f0\nGyf he his \u00e6hta bere geman \u00f0ara unfri\u00f0manna \u00e6hta into huse, \u00f0olie his \u00e6hta & \u00e6bbe sylf fri\u00f0 & feorh,\nGyf se fri\u00f0man fleo o\u00f0\u00f0on feohte & nelle hine cy\u00f0an: gif hine man ofslea, licge ungylde.\nGyf man beo \u00e6t his \u00e6htan bereafod, & he wite of hwilcum scipe, agyfe steoresman \u00f0a \u00e6hta o\u00f0\u00f0on gange\nGyf \u00e6nglisc man Deniscne ofsleo, frigman frigne, gylde hine mid XXV pundum, o\u00f0\u00f0on man \u00f0one\nGyf Englisc man Deniscne \u00f0r\u00e6l ofslea, gylde hine mid punde, & se Denisca Engliscne ealswa, gif he\nGyf eahta men beon ofslagene, \u00f0onne is \u00fe\u00e6t fri\u00f0brec, binnan byrig o\u00f0\u00f0on buton.\nBinnan eahta mannum bete man \u00fe\u00e6t fullum were.\nGyf hit binnan byrig gedon bi\u00f0, seo fri\u00f0br\u00e6c, fare seo buruhwaru sylf to & begyte \u00f0a banan, cuce o\u00f0\u00f0e\nGyf hy nellan, fare se ealdorman to; gif he nelle, fare se cyning to; gif he nelle, licge se ealdordom on\n\u00c6t eallum slyht & \u00e6t ealre \u00f0\u00e6re hergunge & \u00e6t eallum \u00f0am hearmum, \u00f0e \u00e6r \u00f0am gedon w\u00e6re, \u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6t\n& \u00fe\u00e6t na\u00f0or ne hy ne we ne underfon o\u00f0res wealh ne o\u00f0res \u00f0eof ne o\u00f0res gefan.\n& gif man secge on landesmann, \u00fe\u00e6t he orf st\u00e6le o\u00f0\u00f0on man sloge, & hit secge an scei\u00f0man & an\n& gif heora menn slean ure eahta, \u00f0onne beo\u00f0 hy utlage ge wi\u00f0 hy ge wi\u00f0 us & ne beo nanre bote\nTwa and twentig \u00f0usend punda goldes & seolfres man gesealde \u00f0am here of \u00e6nglalande wi\u00f0 fri\u00f0e.\nGyf hwa befo \u00fe\u00e6t him losod w\u00e6s, cenne se, \u00f0e he hit \u00e6t befo, hwanon hit him come; sylle on hand &\nGif he liuiendre handa team gecenne, & sy on o\u00f0ere scire se, \u00f0e he to tym\u00f0, h\u00e6bbe swa langne fyrst,\nSette on \u00f0a hand, \u00f0e hit him sealde, & bidde, \u00fe\u00e6t he cl\u00e6nsie, gif he m\u00e6ge.\nGif he tofeoht, \u00f0onne cl\u00e6nsno\u00f0 he \u00f0ene, \u00f0e hit \u00e6r \u00e6t befangen w\u00e6s.\nCenne he sy\u00f0\u00f0an, hwanan hit him come.\nGif he cenne ofer I scira, h\u00e6bbe I wucena fyrst; gif he cenne ofer II scira, h\u00e6bbe II wucena fyrst; gyf\n& cume hit mon \u00e6ure, \u00f0\u00e6r hit \u00e6rost befangen beo.\nHwilon stod, \u00fe\u00e6t man sceolde \u00f0rywa tyman, \u00f0\u00e6r hit \u00e6rest befangen w\u00e6re, & sy\u00f0\u00f0an fylgean teame, swa\n\u00d0a ger\u00e6ddan witan, \u00fe\u00e6t hit betere w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00e6ure tymde, \u00f0\u00e6r hit \u00e6rest befangen w\u00e6re, swa longe\nSwunce mare se, \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t unriht gestreon on his handa stode, & l\u00e6sse se \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6r ariht onspr\u00e6ce.\nWarige eac hine se \u00f0e his hagen befo\u00f0: he to \u00e6lcan teame h\u00e6bbe getrywne borh & beorge, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nGyf hwa to deadan tyme buton he yruenoman h\u00e6bbe, \u00f0e hit cl\u00e6nsie, geswutelie mid gewitnysse, gif he\n\u00d0onne bi\u00f0 se deada besmiten, buton he frind h\u00e6bbe, \u00f0e hine mid rihte cl\u00e6nsnian, swa he sylf scolde,\nGif he \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6re freonda h\u00e6f\u00f0, \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t don durron, \u00f0onne berst se team, swa wel swa he liues w\u00e6re\nEac betweox teame, gif hwa tofeh\u00f0 & na fur\u00f0or team ne cen\u00f0, ac agnian wile, ne m\u00e6g mon \u00f0\u00e6s",
